1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,259
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:05,559 --> 00:00:10,820
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:19,179
Last time, Qiqi met the lamplighter who never rests.

4
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:26,500
Persisting in doing the right thing is truly remarkable!

5
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:34,859
Today, they arrive at a planet full of books, stacked higher than houses!

6
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:38,819
The little prince and Qiqi kept flying forward.

7
00:00:39,119 --> 00:00:43,179
This time, they came to a planet full of books.

8
00:00:43,479 --> 00:00:47,139
So many books! Stacked higher than houses!

9
00:00:47,439 --> 00:00:49,739
Qiqi curiously opened one.

10
00:00:50,039 --> 00:00:55,539
Wow, it had pictures of mountains, rivers, and oceans!

11
00:00:55,839 --> 00:00:59,579
An old man with round glasses sat among the book piles.

12
00:00:59,879 --> 00:01:01,779
Who are you?

13
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:05,979
I'm a geographer. I write books about the world.

14
00:01:06,279 --> 00:01:10,499
Then you must know so many places!

15
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:14,379
Of course, I've written them all in my books.

16
00:01:14,679 --> 00:01:19,539
Then you must have been to so many places!

17
00:01:19,839 --> 00:01:22,379
The geographer pushed up his glasses.

18
00:01:22,679 --> 00:01:25,539
Me? I've never been outside.

19
00:01:25,839 --> 00:01:26,939
What?!

20
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:29,059
Qiqi's mouth dropped open.

21
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:34,139
Geographers don't go outside. We only write things down.

22
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:38,899
Then who tells you what mountains look like?

23
00:01:39,199 --> 00:01:44,059
Explorers do. They go out and see, then come back and tell me.

24
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:48,739
Qiqi thought, then ran to the book piles and sniffed hard.

25
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:54,779
Mmm... the books smell like paper.

26
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:58,499
But they don't smell like wind.

27
00:01:58,799 --> 00:02:04,539
No smell of flowers, no smell of rain either.

28
00:02:04,839 --> 00:02:06,659
The geographer was stunned.

29
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:12,219
Books hold a lot of knowledge, but only by really going there can you smell the wind.

30
00:02:12,519 --> 00:02:22,099
When I grow up, I'll go see for myself! I'll write the smell of wind into books too!

31
00:02:22,399 --> 00:02:25,259
The geographer smiled and picked up his quill.

32
00:02:25,559 --> 00:02:31,539
Then you'll be an explorer. Go, come back and tell me what the wind on the mountains smells like.

33
00:02:31,839 --> 00:02:36,939
Kids, where would you most like to explore?

34
00:02:37,239 --> 00:02:42,339
Tell Qiqi in the comments~

35
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:49,019
Next time, the little prince is finally reaching Earth!

36
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:55,699
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

